### 3. Reduce Function - O(n) Time Complexity
**Location**: `src/utils/comparisonUtils.ts:112-117`
```typescript
export const getBestForDiabetics = (products: Product[]): Product => {
  return products.reduce((best, current) => {
    const currentScore = calculateDiabeticScore(current);
    const bestScore = calculateDiabeticScore(best);
    return currentScore > bestScore ? current : best;
  });
};
```
**Purpose**: Finds the best product for diabetics using reduction

### 4. Array Intersection - O(n*m) Time Complexity
**Location**: `src/utils/comparison.ts:49`
```typescript
const commonTags = item.tags.filter(tag => currentItem.tags.includes(tag));
```
**Purpose**: Finds common tags between products for similarity scoring

### 5. Circular Array Navigation - O(1) Time Complexity
**Location**: `src/components/ProductSearch.tsx:52,56`
