// Arrow Down: Circular increment
setSelectedIndex(prev => (prev + 1) % searchResults.length);

// Arrow Up: Circular decrement with wraparound
setSelectedIndex(prev => (prev - 1 + searchResults.length) % searchResults.length);
```
**Purpose**: Implements circular navigation in search results

